<title>USA: Trimble CFO John Barnet resigns.</title>
<headline>Trimble CFO John Barnet resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trimble Navigation Co Ltd said on Friday John Barnet had resigned as executive vice president of finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Barnet, who resigned to pursue other business interests, will be replaced by Dennis Ing, Trimble's controller.</p>
